{"seq":16,"slug":"developer-experience-engineering","title":"开发者体验工程","stage":"DONE","category":"devops-tools","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/developer-experience-engineering","rating":{"composite":3.65,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.8,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":3.5,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"开发者体验工程-简介\">开发者体验工程 简介</h1><p>开发者的时间昂贵，而很多时间被<strong>糟糕的工具链、缓慢的反馈、不可复现的环境、找不到的文档</strong>悄悄吞掉。<strong>开发者体验（DX）工程</strong>——以及它的组织形态「平台工程」——就是把开发者当作内部用户，系统性地优化他们「从想法到上线」的体验，让团队既快又不崩。本 hub 面向想提升团队工程效能的工程师、技术负责人与平台团队，从 DX 基础与价值（DX 定义、内外循环、生产力度量、平台工程与黄金路径）讲起，覆盖内循环与快速反馈（本地反馈循环、可复现环境、本地与远程开发）、自动化与工具链（消除重复、本地质量门、CI 作为 DX）、以及文档与知识（文档即代码、自助式平台、降低认知负荷）。贯穿全篇的核心理念是：把开发者当用户、优化最高频的内循环、用自动化消除重复劳动、用黄金路径把最佳实践做成默认、用就近的文档与自助降低认知负荷——让正确的事成为最容易的事。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"dx-foundations-and-value","title":"DX 基础与价值","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/developer-experience-engineering/dx-foundations-and-value","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"what-is-dx-platform-engineering","title":"什么是开发者体验","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/developer-experience-engineering/dx-foundations-and-value/what-is-dx-platform-engineering"},{"seq":2,"slug":"measuring-developer-productivity","title":"度量开发者生产力","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/developer-experience-engineering/dx-foundations-and-value/measuring-developer-productivity"},{"seq":3,"slug":"platform-engineering-golden-path","title":"平台工程与黄金路径","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/developer-experience-engineering/dx-foundations-and-value/platform-engineering-golden-path"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"inner-loop-fast-feedback","title":"内循环与快速反馈","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/developer-experience-engineering/inner-loop-fast-feedback","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"fast-local-feedback-loops","title":"快速的本地反馈循环","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/developer-experience-engineering/inner-loop-fast-feedback/fast-local-feedback-loops"},{"seq":2,"slug":"reproducible-dev-environments","title":"可复现的开发环境","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/developer-experience-engineering/inner-loop-fast-feedback/reproducible-dev-environments"},{"seq":3,"slug":"local-vs-remote-development","title":"本地与远程开发","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/developer-experience-engineering/inner-loop-fast-feedback/local-vs-remote-development"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"automation-and-toolchain","title":"自动化与工具链","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/developer-experience-engineering/automation-and-toolchain","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"eliminating-toil-scaffolding","title":"消除重复劳动","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/developer-experience-engineering/automation-and-toolchain/eliminating-toil-scaffolding"},{"seq":2,"slug":"pre-commit-local-quality-gates","title":"pre-commit 与本地质量门","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/developer-experience-engineering/automation-and-toolchain/pre-commit-local-quality-gates"},{"seq":3,"slug":"ci-as-developer-experience","title":"CI 作为开发者体验","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/developer-experience-engineering/automation-and-toolchain/ci-as-developer-experience"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"documentation-and-knowledge","title":"文档与知识","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/developer-experience-engineering/documentation-and-knowledge","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"docs-as-code","title":"文档即代码","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/developer-experience-engineering/documentation-and-knowledge/docs-as-code"},{"seq":2,"slug":"self-service-platforms","title":"自助式平台","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/developer-experience-engineering/documentation-and-knowledge/self-service-platforms"},{"seq":3,"slug":"reducing-cognitive-load","title":"降低认知负荷","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/developer-experience-engineering/documentation-and-knowledge/reducing-cognitive-load"}]}]}